*. The subsequent statement by Speaker 3 ("Guys, that was his last powdered donut. Don't be so disrespectful.") could be interpreted as a defensive reaction after being caught or realizing they made a mistake by eating it.\n\nGiven the strong rejection of the previous answer (C - second person), and the physical reaction (coughing/choking) immediately followed by a defensive statement from Speaker 3, Speaker 3 is the most likely candidate implicated by the context clues in the audio.\n\nSpeaker 1 = First person\nSpeaker 2 = Second person\nSpeaker 3 = Third person\n\nTherefore, the best choice based on the audio evidence pointing towards the person who reacted physically is the third person.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
