ning Step-by-Step:**\n1. The conversation revolves around getting and paying the check ("ready for the check," "I got it," "Thank you").\n2. The final statement is, "Oh. Says it was declined."\n3. A payment being "declined" occurs immediately after the payment method (usually a card) is processed by a machine.\n4. Therefore, the action performed just before the speaker read the decline message was attempting to process the payment, most commonly by swiping, inserting, or tapping a card.\n5. Choice A, "swipe card," is the most fitting action that results in a decline notification in this scenario.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
